        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Furthermore, it is agreed that the allocation of aide time is to be used as a temporary solution to provide interim relief while the administrator seeks ways to fulfill the class size standard established herein and shall be in addition to the assigned District aide ratio.",
